  "lines": [
    {"text": "October mein India ne UPI pe roz average ek lakh crore rupaye se zyada bheje. Ye pehli baar hua hai. Aur aapka galla abhi bhi sirf cash pe chalta hai?", "wav": "/tmp/claude-0/-home-user-content-machine-videos/e476018b-0024-541c-a764-7f3dc223c5cc/scratchpad/r1114/l1.wav"},
    {"text": "Pehli baat: har jagah UPI lo. Counter pe QR, bill pe QR, delivery wale ke paas bhi QR. Customer ke paas cash nahi, phone hai.", "wav": "/tmp/claude-0/-home-user-content-machine-videos/e476018b-0024-541c-a764-7f3dc223c5cc/scratchpad/r1114/l2.wav"},
    {"text": "Doosri baat: business ka UPI alag rakho, ghar aur dukaan ka paisa mat milao. Teesri baat: payment history dekho. Kaunsa din sabse zyada bikta hai, wahi batata hai stock kab badhana hai.", "wav": "/tmp/claude-0/-home-user-content-machine-videos/e476018b-0024-541c-a764-7f3dc223c5cc/scratchpad/r1114/l3.wav"},
    {"text": "Paisa digital ho gaya, ab system bhi digital banao. Ye reel save karo, aur kisi dukaan wale dost ko bhejo.", "wav": "/tmp/claude-0/-home-user-content-machine-videos/e476018b-0024-541c-a764-7f3dc223c5cc/scratchpad/r1114/l4.wav"}
  ],
